{"policyVersion":3,"items":[{"translations":{"en":["Tenchi Muyo! GXP Paradise Starting","2022 marks the 30th anniversary of the original Tenchi Muyo! Ryo-Ohki OVA series and to celebrate, a brand new Tenchi Muyo! GXP anime series was announced.\n\n\nThe new series, titled Tenchi Muyo! GXP Paradise Beginnings Arc, connects the 4th and 5th seasons of the series and will serve as an introduction to the Paradise War through the eyes of Seina Yamada. \n\n\n\n(Source: Crunchyroll)"],"ja":["天地無用！GXP パラダイス始動編",""]},"airedAt":null,"relations":[{"id":31861,"relation":"prequel"},{"id":40097,"relation":"sequel"}],"id":"mal-54013","ids":{"shikimori":54013,"mal":54013,"anilist":165749,"kodik":"serial-51177"},"kodikIds":["serial-51212","serial-51177"],"kodikRevisions":{"serial-51212":"2023-10-27T06:19:16Z","serial-51177":"2023-10-27T06:54:57Z"},"title":"Тэнти — лишний! Галактическая полиция: Начало рая","originalTitle":"Tenchi Muyou! GXP: Paradise Shidou Hen","alt":"Тэнти — лишний! Галактическая полиция: Начало рая / Tenchi Muyou! GXP: Paradise Shidou-hen Tenchi Muyo! GXP Paradise Starting 天地無用！GXP パラダイス始動編","description":"Эпические злоключения Сэйны переносятся из глубин космоса на родную Землю. За время своих странствий он обзавёлся не только друзьями, но и врагами, и вот теперь ему пора вернуться к тем, кого он любит на родной планете. Но очень скоро он понимает: всё изменилось, и прежним уже не будет.","year":2023,"type":"OVA","genres":["Комедия","тайна","Фантастика","Детектив","гарем","меха","космос"],"rating":6.28,"popularity":1168,"ongoing":false,"relatedMalIds":[31861,40097],"artwork":{"poster":{"url":"https://shikimori.io/uploads/poster/animes/54013/a26451a56e16c1b7d275aa394ceda010.jpeg","width":685,"height":975},"backdrop":{"url":"https://shikimori.io/system/screenshots/original/1442de4dfc9ea9190cef2048476efe30ff5196d1.jpg","width":1920,"height":1080}},"releasedEpisodes":[1,2,3,4,5,6],"episodes":[{"number":1,"ordinal":1,"season":1,"audio":[{"id":"kodik-609","dubId":"609"